set description = '<p>Kannon is one year old and too young to provide an explanation. Taylor said that Philip was at work at Rocky Gregory Construction. She contacted him and this worker saw him via facetime. Taylor stated that she works evenings at Subway and Phillip works day shift. They live with family, Phillip''s aunt and uncle, who help with the children as well. Taylor stated that she was hit with a belt as a child and that will never happen to her children. She stated that they are currently taking Nautika to Wellspring Family Medicine due to the behavior issues and are working with the school to complete some assessments. Phillip''s Uncle John was present and he stated he has told the kids he will beat their butt with a belt and swings the belt at them but he said he has never hit them with a belt. He said he does this as a joke and not when they are in trouble. This worker advised that he not threaten them with the belt. Taylor agreed.</p>', updatedby = 'CDM-20915', updatedon = now()
